    "description": {
      "value": "Your touch calls forth a churning mass of icy water that clings to your target, dealing 1d4 bludgeoning damage and 1d4 cold damage. The target must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\nCritical Success: The target is unaffected.\nSuccess: The target takes half damage and a \u22125-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until the end of your next turn.\nFailure: The target takes full damage and a \u221210-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until the end of your next turn.\nCritical Failure: As failure, but the target takes double damage."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The bludgeoning and cold damage each increase by 1d4."
    },
